        "question": "Where can I see it in Georgia?",
        "answer": "In deciduous and mixed forest and in orchards and parks with large trees. Named points include the type locality near Kutaisi; Borjomi-Kharagauli National Park (photograph, 4 June 2015); and Vake Park in Tbilisi (photograph, 9 February 2025). A 2023 compilation has 71 Georgian records from 1855–2022. This page does not map every region."
